.TH WERKMEISTER-FEATURE-DROP 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-feature\-drop \- Stop a local service, fall back to k8s
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister feature drop\fR <feature> <service>
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Removes the service from the feature's local stack. The service will now be served from k8s. Config files are regenerated and Caddy is reloaded.
.PP
If removing the last service, the feature's containers are fully stopped (though the slot remains allocated — use \fBwerkmeister feature down\fR to release it).
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
werkmeister feature drop my\-feature frontend
.RE
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
